            "review_title": "Review at Pho Hoan",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nLocal Cuisine - Pho Prepared to Order\nNov 2018 • Solo\nI'm rating this place as \"very good\" but this is a subjective scale. I enjoyed my pho but this is not a place that I would consider to be totally \"to a western standard.\" The soups and rice dishes are all about USD 1.25 (30,000 VTD). \n\nThe servers were not particularly friendly but that wasn't surprising since it was quite obvious that they didn't speak English and my Vietnamese is basic at best. However, it was a very delicious pho - one that I'd love to go back to have again. The cool thing was that I could actually see the cook preparing and cooking the meat for my soup.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 15, 2018",
